    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "The goal of this proposed extension of Google Now is to use smartphone technology to make cars more situation aware and responsive, while giving the user more control over their driving environment. In current systems, each car company builds its own interface. The attempts to increase drivers’ awareness can be more distracting than helpful, leading to confusion and often a much lower quality experience than users have with their smartphones.",
